  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p>Hello 👋 I'm so glad you're here!!</p>\r\n<p>Inspired by my personal journey, TEJA was born out of the adversity of a PCOS (Polycystic Ovarian Syndrome) diagnosis. This pivotal time in my life fueled my passion for health and wellness and led me to create a brand that not only supports me, but also serves others on their journeys.</p>\r\n<p>At TEJA Cosmetics, our mission is to revolutionize the beauty industry by creating clean, consciously formulated products that prioritize your hormone health. We are dedicated to replacing your chemical-filled favorites, that no longer serve you, with products that are worthy of your trust.</p>\r\n<p>We're beyond excited to introduce our very first product, a game-changing tinted daily sunscreen. The innovative formula not only protects your face from the sun, but also enhances your natural radiance with our signature glow while providing essential skincare benefits.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Our innovative SPF moisturizer is more than just a face sunscreen; it's a skin loving multitasker!&nbsp; InnerGlow features powerful SPF 40+ broad spectrum protection that blends in seamlessly, leaving no white cast on your skin. We combined staple skincare ingredients like Vitamin E, Niacinamide, and Hyaluronic Acid to give you the most out of this critical skin care step.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">The consciously crafted formula is non-comedogenic, boosts moisture levels throughout wear, protects against free radicals, and strengthens the skin barrier, all while leaving you with a natural glow and perfect dewy base for makeup. We hope you love this product as much as we did creating it!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Payment is via direct bank wire approx. every 2 weeks.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information: Please reach out with any questions at all!!</p>\r\n</div>",
